Id: embed002i
Severity: INFO
Category: filesystem
Check: check_embedded
Fix: chown root the file, or add its owner to Tigris_Embedded_OK_Owners if it is meant to own it.
References: chown(1); tigris.conf (Tigris_Embedded_OK_Owners)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

See the 'embed' explanation for an explanation of the format of the
embedded references.

The file or directory is not owned by an administrative account
(Tigris_Embedded_OK_Owners). This may indicate a vulnerability in the
system. It will be necessary to study the file and programs in which
the pathname was found to determine whether there is a problem.
